---
import TrainingBenefitsImage from "@assets/training-beneficts.webp";
---
<section class="w-full bg-white py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-16 lg:flex-row">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <img
          src={TrainingBenefitsImage.src}
          alt="self paced training illustration"
          class="w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center text-center lg:text-left">
        <h3 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">
          Unleash Your Team&apos;s Full Potential
        </h3>

        <p class="mb-6 text-lg text-slate-500">
          Our immersive 3D gamified training programs empower employees to master
          essential skills efficiently, ensuring they excel in their roles with
          confidence and precision. These tailored simulations create engaging,
          interactive learning experiences that prepare your team for real-world
          challenges and help them thrive in their work environment.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">
          Key Advantages of Simulation-Based Training for Your Organization:
        </h4>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-base text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 text-black">•</span>
            Skill Development: Equip your employees with the necessary skills to
            succeed and adapt within the organization.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 text-black">•</span>
            Collaborative Growth: Foster a sense of teamwork and mutual support
            through dynamic, interactive scenarios.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 text-black">•</span>
            Streamlined Learning: Enable faster and more efficient learning,
            ensuring your team is ready to contribute meaningfully from day one.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
